  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific AML/CFT Capacity Development Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first phase laid important foundations for sustainable AML/CFT progress. A second phase would build on these foundations, focussing on activities that imbed best practices and lift capability long term. In particular, one-on-one mentoring during operational activities, the creation of knowledge repositories and reference materials, and the use of interactive training are intended to have longer term benefits that have traditionally been achieved through one-off training exercises.</narrative>
  </description>
